<title>JAPAN: Honda plans U.S. car exports of 240,000 in 1997/98.</title>
<headline>Honda plans U.S. car exports of 240,000 in 1997/98.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honda Motor Co Ltd said on Thursday that it plans to export 240,000 vehicles to the United States in fiscal 1997/98, up from actual exports of 183,700 vehicles in the previous year.</p>
</text>
